			"quantity": 1,
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "eJt4gAcq274Oc-hMd",
					"description": "Servo-Motor Actuators (Broadside Pattern)",
					"local_notes": "Powered strength for the suit: Lifting ST +26 and Striking ST +13. Counted only here; the parent has no ST bonus. Min ST of mounted weapons is checked against pilot ST + Lifting ST.\n\nLore: Broadside servos let a T'au carry the biggest gun a T'au infantry unit fields.\n\nDesign: Sized so a Broadside's ST 11 + 26 = 37 handles the 90 lb heavy rail rifle (Min ST 30M) with margin, and so the pair of arms can swing as ST 24 if forced into melee.",
