					"quantity": 1,
					"equipped": true
				},
				{
					"id": "eNKNfrtnBOtNCTeXK",
					"description": "Cockpit Interface, Sensors and Life Support (Broadside Pattern)",
					"local_notes": "Sealed cockpit, comm-link, display, targeting sensors, air recycling. +1 to Observation.\n\nLore: Battlesuit pilots fight by instruments.\n\nDesign: As the Crisis suit; a little more for the Broadside's larger sensors and air supply. Flavour subsystem.",
